' KBRAG 架构图（PlantUML）
' 用法：plantuml architecture.puml  -> 生成 architecture.png
' 覆盖两条 LangGraph 链路：build（建索引）与 query（问答，含多轮改写）。

@startuml KBRAG_architecture
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"

title KBRAG 个人知识库 RAG — 两条 LangGraph 链路

package "BUILD 链路（一次性建索引）" {
  [scan\nloader.py + pdf_loader.py\nmd目录 + PDF -> 结构切块] as SCAN
  [embed\nembedder.py\nbge 中文向量化] as EMBED
  [index\nindexer.py\nFAISS 落盘 + chunks.json] as INDEX
  [FAISS 索引\n(ASCII 缓存目录)] as FAISS
  [元数据 chunks.json] as META
  SCAN --> EMBED
  EMBED --> INDEX
  INDEX --> FAISS
  INDEX --> META
}

package "QUERY 链路（问答，多轮）" {
  [exp] as QIN : question\n(可能是追问 + history)
  [rewrite\nrewriter.py\n改写为语义自足 query\n/ Multi-Query 多样化] as REWRITE
  [retrieve\nretriever.py\n向量+BM25 -> RRF\n(可选 CrossEncoder 精排)] as RETR
  [generate\ngenerator.py\n带溯源上下文调 DeepSeek] as GEN
  [检索 LRU 缓存\ncache.py] as CACHE
  QIN --> REWRITE
  REWRITE --> RETR
  RETR --> GEN
  RETR <--> CACHE
}

FAISS --> RETR : 读取向量
META --> RETR : 读取块信息
META --> REWRITE

legend bottom
  技术栈：Python 3.11 / LangGraph / FAISS / bm25s+jieba / bge / DeepSeek API
  CLI：python main.py build | query | chat
endlegend

@enduml